@startuml
title TMFC020 : Digital Identity Management -- eTOM/SID ABE Links
' Per the component's own spec (section 2.1), no eTOM business activity is
' assigned to this component -- the source image's eTOM Business Activity
' box is itself printed "n/a" (with a note elsewhere in the spec that a
' JIRA issue needs to be raised with the eTOM team). Reproduced as-is.

class "n/a" as NA <<eTOM Business Activity>>
class "Digital Identity" as DigitalIdentity <<SID Data Entity>>

' eTOM activity <-> SID ABE link. Per the image's own legend, an arrow from
' the eTOM activity towards the SID ABE means information produced by the
' activity; the reverse arrow means information consumed by the activity.
' The image draws this as two separate arrows sharing a routed corner, i.e.
' both hold simultaneously.
NA --> DigitalIdentity : produces
DigitalIdentity --> NA : is consumed by

footer TMFC020 - Digital Identity Management (as printed in the source image)
@enduml
